(66, 'Maha Mrityunjaya Mantra', 'ॐ त्र्यम्बकं यजामहे सुगन्धिं पुष्टिवर्धनम्। उर्वारुकमिव बन्धनान्मृत्योर्मुक्षीय माऽमृतात्॥', 'Om Tryambakam Yajamahe Sugandhim Pushtivardhanam Urvarukamiva Bandhanan Mrityor Mukshiya Maamritat', 'ॐ तीन नेत्रों वाले शिव को हम पूजते हैं, सुगंधित और पोषक, जैसे खीरा बेल से अलग हो, वैसे ही हमें मृत्यु से मुक्त कर अमृत से जोड़ें', 'Om, We worship the three-eyed Lord Shiva who is fragrant and nourishes all beings, May he liberate us from death for the sake of immortality, Just as the cucumber is separated from its bondage', 2, '/audio/shiva/mrityunjaya.mp3', 0, 0, '2026-03-18 02:18:20', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 'Maha Mrityunjaya (Short Form)', 'ॐ जूं सः', 'Om Joom Sah', 'ॐ जूं सः', 'The seed form of Mrityunjaya mantra', 2, '/audio/shiva/mrityunjaya_short.mp3', 0, 0, '2026-03-18 02:18:20', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
